# Godot runtime (Windows)

- **Executable:** `C:\Godot\Godot_v4.7.2-stable_win64.exe`
- **Project root:** `C:\Code\darkest-tico` (use `--path` with the repo root).

## When to use

- **Smoke check** (loads project, then exits):  
  `"C:\Godot\Godot_v4.7.2-stable_win64.exe" --path "C:\Code\darkest-tico" --headless --quit-after 3`
- **Run game** (windowed): same binary with `--path` and optionally `res://scenes/bootstrap/main.tscn` as positional arg if not using `project.godot` main scene.
- Prefer this path over guessing `godot` on `PATH` when running commands for this repo.

## Notes

- Match **Godot 4.7** with `project.godot` `config/features` (`4.7`).
- If the binary moves, update this rule so agents keep using the correct install.
